      "topic_id": "indices_common_base_equations",
      "prompt": "Solve 125^x = 3125.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Write both sides as powers of 5: 125 = 5^3 and 3125 = 5^5",
        "125^x = 3125 becomes (5^3)^x = 5^5, i.e. 5^(3x) = 5^5",
        "Since the bases match, the powers must be equal: 3x = 5",
        "x = 5/3"
